✔ an explicit result count travels from control input through authoritative State into fixed-source acceptance (31.324916ms)
✔ fixed-source registration refuses unknown IDs and missing bindings (0.290708ms)
✔ frozen H001-H005 registrations do not convert the product default batch target into a user requirement (0.064916ms)
✔ P2-2 conditional selection oracle checks every target and leaves uncompiled reviewer conditions unassessed (85.092958ms)
✔ E1 replay seeds retain both real h001 decisions and leave conditional proposals unscored (101.059041ms)
✔ replay excludeCandidateIds rejects intersections and accepts disjoint candidate sets (0.228417ms)
✔ replay candidateIdsExact compares sets independently of order and rejects missing or extra candidates (0.079708ms)
✔ replay rejects unknown match fields rather than ignoring their requirements (0.218042ms)
✔ replay validates every matching alternative before any model call (15.690458ms)
✔ P1-B original replay preserves complete captured messages and counts the failed call once (68.713542ms)
✔ P1-B static saved DOM uses current Executor targets with scripts and external requests disabled (1542.049333ms)
✔ C1 injection preserves captured goals and targets and limits history to six steps in the same read (1.501458ms)
✔ C8 raw Agent replay injects only categories observed before the decision and preserves legal actions (1.329459ms)
✔ HARD32 merchant course/category literals have independent source and offering scope (3.769583ms)
✔ HARD32 names, customer reviews, recommendations, hidden text and other outlets are not merchant type proof (0.552458ms)
✔ HARD32 lunch can establish venue offering but never a dinner course (0.62025ms)
✔ HARD32 rejects wrong artifact, candidate, provider, source, snapshot hash, late and superseded facts (3.906958ms)
✔ HARD32 manually reviewed witness is bounded to outlet, request, original raw quote and review hashes (1.792375ms)
✔ recorded timing partitions nested model, calendar and source time without inventing missing timestamps (4.24375ms)
